{# AI Visibility Audit — editorial research-report layout.

Type stack:
  - Spectral (Production Type, free on Google Fonts) — display + body
  - Hanken Grotesk (Hanken Design Co.) — labels, numerics, metadata
  Both pulled at render time via Playwright with wait_until="networkidle".

Status conventions (no colored side-borders — small inline marks only):
  loss/losing   ▼  rust accent label
  untapped      ○  ink-muted label
  tied          =  ink-muted label
  lead/ahead    ▲  positive label
  uncontested   ●  positive label
#}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<title>AI Visibility Audit — {{ business_name }}</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Spectral:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,600&family=Hanken+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" />
<style>
  /* ─────────────────────── palette (oklch, warm-tinted neutrals) ─────────────────────── */
  :root {
    --paper:       oklch(0.985 0.005 80);   /* warm cream */
    --paper-soft:  oklch(0.965 0.008 75);   /* slightly darker, for callouts */
    --ink:         oklch(0.20 0.012 55);    /* deep warm black for display */
    --ink-body:    oklch(0.32 0.010 55);    /* body prose */
    --ink-muted:   oklch(0.50 0.008 55);    /* labels, secondary */
    --ink-faint:   oklch(0.62 0.006 55);    /* tertiary metadata */
    --rule:        oklch(0.82 0.008 60);    /* hairlines */
    --rule-faint:  oklch(0.91 0.005 60);    /* fainter dividers */
    --accent:      oklch(0.52 0.16 35);     /* burnt sienna / rust — used sparingly */
    --accent-soft: oklch(0.92 0.025 35);    /* pale rust wash */
    --positive:    oklch(0.50 0.085 145);   /* muted forest, used for ahead/uncontested */
  }

  @page { size: Letter; margin: 0; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink-body);
    font-family: "Spectral", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-size: 10pt;
    line-height: 1.55;
    font-feature-settings: "kern" 1, "liga" 1, "onum" 1;
    -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
    print-color-adjust: exact;
  }

  /* ─────────────────────── page primitives ─────────────────────── */
  .page {
    width: 8.5in;
    min-height: 11in;
    max-height: 11in;
    padding: 0.5in 0.65in 0.5in;
    position: relative;
    background: var(--paper);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .page + .page { page-break-before: always; }
  .page-body { flex: 1; min-height: 0; }

  /* ─────────────────────── masthead + footer ─────────────────────── */
  .masthead {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding-bottom: 8pt;
    border-bottom: 0.5pt solid var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 20pt;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .masthead .mark {
    font-family: "Hanken Grotesk", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 8.5pt;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: 1.2pt;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .masthead .mark .sep {
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    margin: 0 6pt;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .masthead .mark .doc {
    color: var(--ink-body);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.8pt;
  }
  .masthead .meta {
    font-family: "Hanken Grotesk", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 8.5pt;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.8pt;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .masthead .meta-name {
    font-family: "Spectral", Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 11pt;
    color: var(--ink-body);
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-transform: none;
  }

  .footer {
    margin-top: 16pt;
    padding-top: 8pt;
    border-top: 0.5pt solid var(--rule);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    font-family: "Hanken Grotesk", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 7.5pt;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    letter-spacing: 0.3pt;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .footer .who { font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.8pt; }

  /* ─────────────────────── typography ─────────────────────── */
  h1, h2, h3 { margin: 0; font-weight: 400; color: var(--ink); }
  p { margin: 0 0 9pt; }
  p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .business-name {
    font-family: "Spectral", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 34pt;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.0;
    letter-spacing: -0.9pt;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 6pt;
    word-break: break-word;
  }
  .business-sub {
    font-family: "Hanken Grotesk", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 9pt;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.8pt;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 26pt;
  }

  .hook {
    font-family: "Spectral", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 25pt;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.3pt;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 12pt;
    max-width: 6.3in;
  }
  .hook em { font-style: italic; font-weight: 400; }
  .hook .accent {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-variant-numeric: lining-nums;
  }
  .hook-sub {
    font-family: "Spectral", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 12pt;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    max-width: 5.3in;
    margin: 0 0 22pt;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  /* ─────────────────────── section markers ─────────────────────── */
  .section { margin-top: 22pt; }
  .section + .section { margin-top: 20pt; }
  .section-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 14pt;
    padding-bottom: 7pt;
    border-bottom: 0.5pt solid var(--rule);
    margin-bottom: 14pt;
    page-break-after: avoid;
  }
  .section-prose, .focus-block, .prompt-table thead, .recs ol li { break-inside: avoid; }
  .section-num {
    font-family: "Spectral", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 20pt;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: -0.4pt;
    line-height: 1;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums lining-nums;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-family: "Hanken Grotesk", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 9.5pt;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: 0.8pt;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .section-tagline {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-family: "Spectral", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 9.5pt;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }
  .section-prose {
    font-family: "Spectral", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 11pt;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink-body);
    max-width: 5.6in;
  }
  .section-prose strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
  .section-prose .accent { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 500; }

  /* ─────────────────────── cover chart ─────────────────────── */
  .chart {
    margin: 6pt 0 18pt;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .chart-label {
    font-family: "Hanken Grotesk", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 7.5pt;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: 0.8pt;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding-bottom: 6pt;
    margin-bottom: 14pt;
    border-bottom: 0.5pt solid var(--ink);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
  }
  .chart-label .right {
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.4pt;
    text-transform: none;
    font-family: "Spectral", Georgia, serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 9pt;
  }
  .chart-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 56pt 1fr 56pt;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14pt;
    padding: 9pt 0;
    border-bottom: 0.5pt solid var(--rule-faint);
  }
  .chart-row:last-of-type { border-bottom: 0; }
  .chart-row .name {
    font-family: "Hanken Grotesk", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 8pt;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.6pt;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .chart-row .track {
    position: relative;
    height: 14pt;
    background: var(--paper-soft);
    border: 0.5pt solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .chart-row .fill {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0 auto 0 0;
    height: 100%;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .chart-row.is-you .fill   { background: var(--ink); }
  .chart-row.is-peer .fill  { background: var(--ink-muted); }
  .chart-row.is-miss .fill  { background: var(--accent); }
  .chart-row.is-zero .track::after {
    /* visible marker for 0% so the bar reads as "empty, not missing data" */
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 50%;
    width: 3pt;
    height: 3pt;
    background: var(--ink-muted);
    transform: translateY(-50%);
  }
  .chart-row .pct {
    font-family: "Hanken Grotesk", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 13pt;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-align: right;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums lining-nums;
    letter-spacing: -0.3pt;
  }
  .chart-row.is-zero .pct { color: var(--accent); }
  .chart-row .pct .pct-unit { color: var(--ink-faint); font-size: 9pt; margin-left: 1pt; font-weight: 500; }

  .chart-meta {
    margin-top: 16pt;
    font-family: "Hanken Grotesk", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 9pt;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 56pt 1fr;
    gap: 6pt 14pt;
    padding-top: 11pt;
    border-top: 0.5pt solid var(--rule-faint);
  }
  .chart-meta dt {
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 1.2pt;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font-size: 7.5pt;
    align-self: baseline;
  }
  .chart-meta dd { margin: 0; color: var(--ink-body); font-family: "Spectral", Georgia, serif; font-size: 9.5pt; }
  .chart-meta dd strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }

  /* ─────────────────────── per-prompt table ─────────────────────── */
  .prompt-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-family: "Spectral", Georgia, serif;
  }
  .prompt-table thead th {
    font-family: "Hanken Grotesk", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 7.5pt;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    letter-spacing: 0.8pt;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 4pt 0 9pt;
    border-bottom: 0.5pt solid var(--ink);
    text-align: left;
    vertical-align: bottom;
  }
  .prompt-table thead th.num { width: 24pt; }
  .prompt-table thead th.you, .prompt-table thead th.peers { width: 56pt; text-align: right; }
  .prompt-table thead th.status { width: 76pt; text-align: right; }
  .prompt-table tbody tr {
    border-bottom: 0.5pt solid var(--rule-faint);
    page-break-inside: avoid;
  }
  .prompt-table tbody tr.divider td {
    padding: 0;
    border-bottom: 0.5pt solid var(--rule);
    height: 0;
    line-height: 0;
  }
  .prompt-table tbody td {
    padding: 6pt 0;
    font-size: 9.75pt;
    color: var(--ink-body);
    line-height: 1.35;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  .prompt-table tbody td.num {
    font-family: "Hanken Grotesk", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 9pt;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums lining-nums;
    font-weight: 500;
    padding-right: 4pt;
  }
  .prompt-table tbody td.q {
    padding-right: 12pt;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 10pt;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .prompt-table tbody td.you, .prompt-table tbody td.peers {
    font-family: "Hanken Grotesk", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 10.5pt;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
    text-align: right;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums lining-nums;
    letter-spacing: -0.2pt;
  }
  .prompt-table tbody td.you .unit, .prompt-table tbody td.peers .unit {
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font-size: 8pt;
    margin-left: 1pt;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .prompt-table tbody td.peers { color: var(--ink-muted); }
  .prompt-table tbody td.status {
    text-align: right;
    font-family: "Hanken Grotesk", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 7.5pt;
    letter-spacing: 0.6pt;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }
  .prompt-table tbody td.status .mark { margin-right: 5pt; font-size: 8.5pt; }

  .status-loss        { color: var(--accent) !important; }
  .status-loss .mark  { color: var(--accent); }
  .status-untapped    { color: var(--ink-muted) !important; }
  .status-tied        { color: var(--ink-muted) !important; }
  .status-lead        { color: var(--positive) !important; }
  .status-uncontested { color: var(--positive) !important; }

  .legend {
    margin-top: 10pt;
    padding-top: 8pt;
    border-top: 0.5pt solid var(--rule-faint);
    font-family: "Hanken Grotesk", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 7pt;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    letter-spacing: 0.3pt;
    display: flex;
    gap: 16pt;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .legend span .mark { margin-right: 4pt; font-size: 8pt; }

  /* ─────────────────────── focus blocks ─────────────────────── */
  .focus-block {
    margin-bottom: 10pt;
    page-break-inside: avoid;
    max-width: 6.3in;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 24pt 1fr;
    gap: 4pt 12pt;
    padding-bottom: 10pt;
    border-bottom: 0.5pt solid var(--rule-faint);
  }
  .focus-block:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; padding-bottom: 0; border-bottom: 0; }
  .focus-block .marker {
    font-family: "Spectral", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 11pt;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums lining-nums;
    line-height: 1.3;
    text-align: right;
    padding-top: 0;
  }
  .focus-block .body { min-width: 0; }
  .focus-block .q {
    font-family: "Spectral", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 9pt;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    margin: 0 0 3pt;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .focus-block .q::before { content: "“"; }
  .focus-block .q::after { content: "”"; }
  .focus-block .lede {
    font-family: "Spectral", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 10pt;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .focus-block .lede strong { font-weight: 600; }
  .focus-block .lede .accent { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 500; }
  .focus-block .lede .quiet { color: var(--ink-muted); }

  /* ─────────────────────── recommendations ─────────────────────── */
  .recs ol {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    counter-reset: rec;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .recs ol li {
    counter-increment: rec;
    position: relative;
    padding: 9pt 0 9pt 30pt;
    border-bottom: 0.5pt solid var(--rule-faint);
    font-family: "Spectral", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 9.75pt;
    color: var(--ink-body);
    line-height: 1.45;
    page-break-inside: avoid;
    max-width: 6.3in;
  }
  .recs ol li:first-child { padding-top: 3pt; }
  .recs ol li:last-child { border-bottom: 0; padding-bottom: 0; }
  .recs ol li::before {
    content: counter(rec, decimal-leading-zero);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 10pt;
    font-family: "Spectral", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 11pt;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: 0;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums lining-nums;
  }
  .recs ol li:first-child::before { top: 4pt; }
  .recs ol li p { margin: 0 0 4pt; }
  .recs ol li p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .recs ol li strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }

  /* fallback static recs (markdown not provided) */
  .recs-static {
    font-family: "Spectral", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 10.25pt;
    color: var(--ink-body);
    line-height: 1.55;
    max-width: 6.2in;
  }
  .recs-static p { margin: 0 0 10pt; }
  .recs-static ul { margin: 6pt 0 0; padding-left: 18pt; }
  .recs-static li { margin-bottom: 6pt; }
  .recs-static strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }

  /* ─────────────────────── CTA page ─────────────────────── */
  .cta-hook {
    font-family: "Spectral", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 30pt;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.6pt;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 14pt;
    max-width: 6in;
  }
  .cta-hook .accent { color: var(--accent); }
  .cta-intro {
    font-family: "Spectral", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 11.5pt;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink-body);
    max-width: 5.6in;
    margin: 0 0 26pt;
  }
  .cta-intro strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }

  .cta-two {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 38pt;
    margin-bottom: 28pt;
  }
  .cta-col h3 {
    font-family: "Hanken Grotesk", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 8.5pt;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    letter-spacing: 1pt;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0 0 12pt;
    padding-bottom: 8pt;
    border-bottom: 0.5pt solid var(--rule);
  }
  .cta-col dl { margin: 0; }
  .cta-col dt {
    font-family: "Spectral", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 10.5pt;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 3pt;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }
  .cta-col dd {
    font-family: "Spectral", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 9.5pt;
    color: var(--ink-body);
    line-height: 1.45;
    margin: 0 0 10pt;
  }
  .cta-col dd:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .cta-action {
    padding: 18pt 0 0;
    border-top: 0.5pt solid var(--ink);
    margin-top: 6pt;
  }
  .cta-action .ask {
    font-family: "Spectral", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 12.5pt;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 14pt;
    max-width: 5.6in;
  }
  .cta-action .ask strong { font-weight: 600; }
  .cta-links {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: max-content 1fr;
    gap: 6pt 18pt;
    font-family: "Hanken Grotesk", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 10pt;
    color: var(--ink);
    align-items: baseline;
  }
  .cta-links .label {
    font-size: 7.5pt;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    letter-spacing: 0.8pt;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .cta-links a {
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 0.5pt solid var(--accent);
    padding-bottom: 1pt;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     PAGE 1 — COVER + EXECUTIVE SUMMARY
     ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="page">
  <div class="masthead">
    <div class="mark">
      Lumidian<span class="sep">·</span><span class="doc">AI Visibility Audit</span>
    </div>
    <div class="meta">{{ audit_month }}</div>
  </div>

  <div class="page-body">
    <h1 class="business-name">{{ business_name }}</h1>
    <div class="business-sub">
      {%- if location %}{{ location }}{% else %}Prospect{% endif -%}
    </div>

    <p class="hook">{{ cover_hook_html|safe }}</p>
    <p class="hook-sub">{{ cover_sub }}</p>

    {# ───────── cover chart: 3-row horizontal bar comparison ───────── #}
    <div class="chart">
      <div class="chart-label">
        <span>Share of relevant AI searches</span>
        <span class="right">90 queries · 3 models · 3 runs</span>
      </div>

      <div class="chart-row is-you{% if overall_visibility_pct|round|int == 0 %} is-zero{% endif %}">
        <div class="name">You</div>
        <div class="track"><div class="fill" style="width: {{ overall_visibility_pct }}%;"></div></div>
        <div class="pct">{{ overall_visibility_pct|round|int }}<span class="pct-unit">%</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="chart-row is-peer{% if peer_avg_overall|round|int == 0 %} is-zero{% endif %}">
        <div class="name">Peers</div>
        <div class="track"><div class="fill" style="width: {{ peer_avg_overall }}%;"></div></div>
        <div class="pct">{{ peer_avg_overall|round|int }}<span class="pct-unit">%</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="chart-row is-miss">
        <div class="name">Missing</div>
        <div class="track"><div class="fill" style="width: {{ missing_pct }}%;"></div></div>
        <div class="pct">{{ missing_pct|round|int }}<span class="pct-unit">%</span></div>
      </div>

      <dl class="chart-meta">
        <dt>Peers</dt>
        <dd><strong>{{ peer_names_joined }}</strong></dd>
        <dt>Models</dt>
        <dd>ChatGPT search · Perplexity Sonar-Pro · Gemini 2.5 Flash</dd>
      </dl>
    </div>

    {# ───────── executive summary (right under the chart) ───────── #}
    <div class="section">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="section-num">01</div>
        <div class="section-title">Executive Summary</div>
        <div class="section-tagline">Where {{ business_name }} stands today</div>
      </div>
      <div class="section-prose">
        <p>{{ summary_lead }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <span class="who">Prepared by Lumidian</span>
    <span>{{ generated_label }}</span>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     PAGE 2 — PER-PROMPT BREAKDOWN
     ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="page">
  <div class="masthead">
    <div class="mark">
      Lumidian<span class="sep">·</span><span class="doc">AI Visibility Audit</span>
    </div>
    <div class="meta meta-name">{{ business_name }}</div>
  </div>

  <div class="page-body">
    <div class="section" style="margin-top: 0;">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="section-num">02</div>
        <div class="section-title">Per-prompt Breakdown</div>
        <div class="section-tagline">All 10 prompts, sorted by what needs attention</div>
      </div>

      <table class="prompt-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th class="num">#</th>
            <th class="q">Prompt</th>
            <th class="you">You</th>
            <th class="peers">Peers</th>
            <th class="status">Status</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% set ns = namespace(prev_kind=None) %}
          {% for ps in scorecard %}
            {% if ns.prev_kind and ns.prev_kind != ps.kind %}
              <tr class="divider"><td colspan="5"></td></tr>
            {% endif %}
            <tr>
              <td class="num">{{ "%02d"|format(loop.index) }}</td>
              <td class="q">{{ ps.prompt_text }}</td>
              <td class="you">{{ ps.own_visibility_pct|round|int }}<span class="unit">%</span></td>
              <td class="peers">{{ ps.peer_avg_visibility_pct|round|int }}<span class="unit">%</span></td>
              <td class="status status-{{ ps.kind }}">
                {%- if ps.kind == 'loss' %}<span class="mark">▼</span>Losing
                {%- elif ps.kind == 'untapped' %}<span class="mark">○</span>Untapped
                {%- elif ps.kind == 'tied' %}<span class="mark">=</span>Tied
                {%- elif ps.kind == 'lead' %}<span class="mark">▲</span>Ahead
                {%- elif ps.kind == 'uncontested' %}<span class="mark">●</span>Uncontested
                {%- endif -%}
              </td>
            </tr>
            {% set ns.prev_kind = ps.kind %}
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <div class="legend">
        <span class="status-loss"><span class="mark">▼</span>Losing — peers ahead</span>
        <span class="status-untapped"><span class="mark">○</span>Untapped — no one cited</span>
        <span class="status-lead"><span class="mark">▲</span>Ahead — you lead peers</span>
        <span class="status-uncontested"><span class="mark">●</span>Uncontested — only you</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    {# ───────── 03 · where to focus first (on same page if room) ───────── #}
    <div class="section">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="section-num">03</div>
        <div class="section-title">Where to Focus First</div>
        <div class="section-tagline">Three prompts that tell the full story</div>
      </div>

      {% for w in action_blocks %}
      <div class="focus-block">
        <div class="marker">{{ "%02d"|format(loop.index) }}</div>
        <div class="body">
          <p class="q">{{ w.prompt_text }}</p>
          <p class="lede">
            {%- if w.kind == 'loss' and w.top_competitor_name -%}
              <strong>{{ w.top_competitor_name }}</strong> dominates this question with <span class="accent">{{ w.top_competitor_visibility_pct|round|int }}%</span> visibility — you're at <span class="accent">{{ w.own_visibility_pct|round|int }}%</span>. <span class="quiet">AI models are pulling from competitor content; closing the gap means publishing on the same surfaces being cited — LinkedIn, Medium, Reddit, Quora.</span>
            {%- elif w.kind == 'loss' -%}
              Competitors collectively appear in <span class="accent">{{ w.peer_avg_visibility_pct|round|int }}%</span> of responses — you're at <span class="accent">{{ w.own_visibility_pct|round|int }}%</span>. <span class="quiet">Same playbook: match where competitors are being cited from, not just on your own domain.</span>
            {%- elif w.kind == 'untapped' -%}
              {%- if w.variant_index == 0 -%}
                Nobody surfaces here yet — not you, not your peers. Whoever publishes first owns this question in AI search. <span class="quiet">A single well-structured long-form piece can become the citation across all three models. First mover wins.</span>
              {%- elif w.variant_index == 1 -%}
                Another open category — zero competitor content, zero from you. AI models default to generic answers because no source is authoritative. <span class="quiet">Different topic, same dynamic: one detailed answer published on the right surfaces becomes the default citation.</span>
              {%- else -%}
                A third clear opening — this query has no clear winner in {{ location or "your market" }}, just placeholder text from AI models. <span class="quiet">Zero competitor presence means low effort to dominate.</span>
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- elif w.kind == 'uncontested' -%}
              Only you appear in responses to this — peers are at <strong>0%</strong>. <span class="quiet">A fragile lead: any competitor publishing one strong piece could flip the citation.</span>
            {%- elif w.kind == 'tied' -%}
              You and competitors are tied at <strong>{{ w.own_visibility_pct|round|int }}%</strong>. <span class="quiet">A small content push pulls you clear of the pack.</span>
            {%- else -%}
              You're ahead at <strong>{{ w.own_visibility_pct|round|int }}%</strong> vs peers at <strong>{{ w.peer_avg_visibility_pct|round|int }}%</strong>. <span class="quiet">Defend the lead with regular updates and structured schema so AI models keep citing you.</span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <span class="who">{{ business_name }}</span>
    <span>{{ generated_label }}</span>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     PAGE 3 — RECOMMENDATIONS
     ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
